[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4749.91, "timestamp": "01:19:09", "text": "我想我会去。好了，我准备好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4754.55, "timestamp": "01:19:14", "text": "我们发出嘘声。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4757.11, "timestamp": "01:19:17", "text": "我明白了，我忘了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4767.669, "timestamp": "01:19:27", "text": "等等，这是最高难度吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4771.59, "timestamp": "01:19:31", "text": "不，呃，第二个。绝对地。不。哦，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4772.87, "timestamp": "01:19:32", "text": "难度并非最高。就这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4775.51, "timestamp": "01:19:35", "text": "你需要知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4777.35, "timestamp": "01:19:37", "text": "这不算是超级地狱潜水。简直是地狱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4779.03, "timestamp": "01:19:39", "text": "潜水。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4780.63, "timestamp": "01:19:40", "text": "直接跳进地狱。不用担心。你只有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4781.99, "timestamp": "01:19:41", "text": "需要知道，这并非最难的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4789.189, "timestamp": "01:19:49", "text": "但我认为舒马先生几乎需要这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4791.669, "timestamp": "01:19:51", "text": "这样我们就可以向杰奎展示什么是超级棒的了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4794.39, "timestamp": "01:19:54", "text": "地狱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4797.11, "timestamp": "01:19:57", "text": "我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4799.83, "timestamp": "01:19:59", "text": "再次。是的。一遍又一遍"}]